meta {
  name: DreamHomes Haven — Dream AI compare smoke
  type: collection
}

docs {
  # Smoke pass for the AI-backed Dream AI compare endpoint

  Validates the Phase-2 compare path:
  - URL-trigger: prompt with two `/listings/N` paths returns
    `kind: compare` with `compareReasoning.recommendedListingId` +
    `perListing[]` notes (pros / cons / bestFor) when
    `HAVEN_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` is set.
  - Conversation trigger: a follow-up like "which is best for me?" on a
    chat that just returned listings routes through compare too.
  - Stub fallback: same prompts return `kind: compare` with the legacy
    markdown when the key is unset (no LLM call).

  ## How to run

  Public — no login required. Compare endpoint is part of the public
  Dream AI surface (per the SecurityConfig override added when Vista's
  SSR backend started calling `/api/dream-ai/suggestions`).

  GUI:  open the collection, pick env Prod, run the folder
  CLI:  cd audit/bruno/DreamAiCompare  &&  bru run . -r --env Prod

  ## Pre-reqs on prod

  Listings #1 (Lekki) and #4 (Ikeja) must be LIVE — they are after a
  fresh Seed run. The script uses these specific ids so the request is
  reproducible across reseeds.
}
